@voice taavek
// Writer (command: guests). Taavek (they/them), Veyli engineer (the Veyli vessel, 3 days). Works in the Works bay. Came
// aboard with a crate of parts and no common words for most of them. Sketches every machine. Trades Veyli sweets for
// coffee. Workaholic.
// HOW THEY TALK: few common words, used with care; points, sketches, mimes; laughs easily at the gaps.
// NEVER: gives up on a word; refuses coffee.
tpl: playful
talk: Few common words, carefully used; points and sketches the rest; laughs easily at the gaps.
cares: the crate of parts | sketching every machine | coffee
jokes: no common word for most of the parts, so everything is "the round one" | trades Veyli sweets for coffee
hi: Hello! | Good day
bye: Go well | Goodbye, yes
yes: Yes, yes | Good
thanks: Thank you | Good, thank you
wow: Ah! Good machine
sigh: Ah
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: practical
openness: open
loves: made | sweet
likes: tea
invites: works-tea
joy: sketching a new machine
thread: startover
keepsake: a sketch of your favourite machine, labelled in Veyli
avoid: rushing
